<Bindings>
    <!--
        Bindings for the bars Blizzard has no binding family for.

        Pages 2 and 7-10 (slots 13-24 and 73-120) are real action slots that no Blizzard bar
        exposes, so the client ships no ACTIONBUTTON/MULTIACTIONBAR* names for them. ElvUI
        declares its own for the same blocks; these are SuuUI's.

        The bodies are EMPTY on purpose. A binding declared here only gives the player a name
        to assign a key to in the Key Bindings UI; the key is then routed to a CLICK on the
        secure button via SetOverrideBindingClick, which is the only way an addon can trigger
        a protected UseAction. A Lua body calling UseAction directly would be refused.
    -->
    <!-- Bar 9: page 2, slots 13-24 -->
    <Binding name="SUUUIBAR9BUTTON1" header="SUUUI_BAR9" category="SUUUI_ACTIONBARS" />
